      "message": "I believe that packageInfo.providers / receivers / activities / services all are a ComponentInfo\n\nWe can have a method that take the array and iter (independently of the type of it) to reduce code duplicate ? even it that imply checking the opp activities for every of them, I think it\u0027s fine since this code is not supposed to run that often\n\n```\n\n[...]\n    disableBluetoothComponents(packageName, packageInfo.services);\n    disableBluetoothComponents(packageName, packageInfo.receivers);\n    disableBluetoothComponents(packageName, packageInfo.providers);\n}\n\nprivate disableBluetoothComponents(String packageName, ComponentInfo[] componentInfos) {\n    if (componentInfos \u003d\u003d null) {\n        return;\n    }\n    Arrays.stream(componentInfos)\n        .filter(ComponentInfo::isEnabled)\n        .map(componentInfo -\u003e new ComponentName(packageName, componentInfo.name))\n        .filter(c -\u003e !baseBluetoothOppActivities.contains(c.getClassName()))\n        .forEach(componentName -\u003e {\n            pm.setComponentEnabledSetting(\n                componentName,\n                PackageManager.COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE_DISABLED,\n                PackageManager.DONT_KILL_APP);\n            Log.i(TAG, \"Disabled component: \" + componentName.getClassName());\n        });\n}\n```",
